{"type":"text","timestamp":1794251970869,"sessionID":"ses_e3e44e0f6ffeyev5Rf7ZjOeZTU","part":{"id":"prt_1c1c05910001tGsNwIckTDkx3R","messageID":"msg_1c1c029a3001wgRLuHlvhpHSyU","sessionID":"ses_e3e44e0f6ffeyev5Rf7ZjOeZTU","type":"text","text":"I built the book library on top of the starter project, with the Flask API in `backend/app.py` and the React frontend in `frontend/src/App.tsx` and `frontend/src/api.ts`. The API passed a scripted run against the server, and the frontend type-checks and builds. Two things weren't checked: I couldn't build the Docker image (Docker isn't available here), and I didn't click through the web pages in a browser.\n\n**What the test run covered:** register and login, 401 without a valid token, add/edit/delete a book (deleting also removes its reviews), validation messages, a 409 when someone reviews the same book twice, average rating (4 and 5 gave 4.5), search and paging, and newest-first order. Under gunicorn I also confirmed `/api/health`, that the frontend loads (including direct links to a book page), and that the database is created as `data/library.db`.\n\n**Rules you didn't specify, which I chose:**\n- Usernames are 1–64 characters with no spaces, and the same name with different capitals counts as taken. Passwords need at least 4 characters. A taken username gets a 409.\n- Ratings are whole numbers from 1 to 5; comments are optional.\n- `year` must be between 1 and next year. `isbn` must be 10 or 13 digits (hyphens and spaces allowed; ISBN-10 may end in X).\n- Validation errors come back as 400 with `{\"error\": ..., \"errors\": {field: message}}`, and the forms show each message under its field.\n- Search matches title, author or ISBN. Pages hold 20 books by default and at most 100.\n- Login also returns `username`. I added `GET /api/auth/me` and `POST /api/auth/logout`; the sign-out button uses the latter.\n\n**Changes to project files:**\n- **`backend/requirements.lock`:** it mixed hashed pins with an unhashed `requirements.txt`, so `pip install` failed. I rewrote it as plain version pins (same versions).\n- **Frontend packages:** added Tailwind v4 (its entry file is `src/index.css`), TypeScript, React type definitions, a `tsconfig.json` and an `npm run typecheck` script; `package-lock.json` is updated.\n- **`.gitignore`:** new; it covers `.venv/`, `data/`, `node_modules/` and `frontend/dist/`.\n\nI couldn't write to `/tmp/opencode`, so the local test environment is in `.venv/`. It's ignored by git and Docker.\n\nTo check: `cd frontend && npm run typecheck && npm run build`.","time":{"start":1794251970832,"end":1794251970837}}}
